{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-atomic-valence-open-sites","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:atomic-valence-open-sites","kind":"definition","title":"Valence and lone pairs as open bonding sites","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-electron-shell-braid-capacity"],"tags":["valence","lone-pair","open-sites","covalent-bond"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.Molecular.atomicValence","text":"atomic-valence-open-sites.md","leanSource":"atomic-valence-open-sites.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:atomic-valence-open-sites\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">Z_{\\mathrm{val}}</code> be the number of valence electrons of an atom of atomic number <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">Z</code> and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">n_{\\mathrm{val}}</code> its outermost shell level. The <strong>valence</strong> of the atom, the number of open bonding sites available for covalent bonds, is</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  v(Z) = \\min\\bigl(Z_{\\mathrm{val}},\\; 2n_{\\mathrm{val}}^2 - Z_{\\mathrm{val}}\\bigr).</code></pre>\n<p>A <strong>lone pair</strong> is an electron pair whose <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Phi_1</code> contribution is lower when bound to a single nucleus than when shared.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/atomic-valence-open-sites.md","heading":"Definition","number":"18.3.3","page":"b/def-atomic-valence-open-sites","qa":{"counts":{"pass":81,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":11,"unknown":0,"stale":64},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.Molecular.atomicValence","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/atomic-valence-open-sites.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
